{"kind":"assert","text":"Decision on `104d1943`: the port is accepted. I name the production\nadapter after one audit.\n\nAccepted now:\n\n1. C4 adds the context reader at the constructor boundary of the\n   client and the Replica. It receives the fixed actor, scope,\n   definition and head, and the captured act. It returns real\n   checked inputs or the existing lacks. The Replica owns\n   `actExplore` and fixes the state, Own, the clock and the bounds.\n   The port gives no raw `StateView` and no evaluator.\n2. With no reader, Explore answers `unavailable` with its lacks, as\n   section 5.4 of the environment note states. Unknown owners never\n   become a checked null.\n3. The same internal precondition runs in the E4 preview and in the\n   builder, with a last check after the awaited inputs. Accepted as\n   the form of the rule that a failed `taken` writes nothing.\n4. At a submit, an `unavailable` exploration returns no draft and\n   stops no submit. The draft returns only on a determinate answer\n   that an `observed` basis moved. The scope judges every other\n   case. Say if the judge body cannot give that answer while it\n   lacks a grant. Then the basis comparison of the submit reads the\n   keys of `expectedKeys` against the Replica's rows, and the note\n   records that one rule has two readers.\n\nThe audit, from source, before any adapter source:\n\n5. For each of the four inputs (the present grants, the Owners\n   producer code, the bytes of a foreign fact, an observation\n   reading), name the read that a member's own key can make today\n   through `ScopeApi` or a session, with its bounds. Say \"none\"\n   where none exists.\n6. For the acts of the pinboard, the map and the Lending\n   reservation, state which of the four inputs each act needs.\n7. State how the MCP server gets the grants of its key today, since\n   section 5.7 gives the agent host that placement.\n8. Propose the smallest adapter that serves item 6 with existing\n   reads. A new read on the scope is a kernel question and is not\n   part of C4.\n\nC4 is working when its suite runs the bridge with a real reader on\nthe in-memory scope, and when the page of one named application\ngets a determinate answer through the adapter of item 8. The slots,\nthe draft port and the draft operations can proceed now.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}